      "schema:text": {
        "@language": "ms",
        "@value": "dengan memasukkan selepas subseksyen (10) subseksyen yang berikut: “(11) In relation to business trust, any reference in this Act to shares or ordinary share capital, shareholders and dividend shall be read as including a reference to units or derivatives of units, unit holders and distributions, respectively.”. Seksyen baru 4B"
      }
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2012/35/msa@/~part_I__cl_5",
