      "isPartOf": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2012/35/msa@/~part_I__cl_6",
      "schema:text": {
        "@language": "ms",
        "@value": "dengan menggantikan noktah di hujung perenggan (k) dengan koma bernoktah; dan"
      }
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2012/35/msa@/~part_I__cl_6__para_b",
      "@type": "akn:paragraph",
      "eli:number": "b",
      "isPartOf": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2012/35/msa@/~part_I__cl_6",
      "schema:text": {
        "@language": "ms",
        "@value": "dengan memasukkan selepas perenggan (k), perenggan yang berikut: “(l) subject to section 109G but notwithstanding any other provisions of this Act, income tax shall be charged for a year of assessment upon the income of an individual consisting of a withdrawal of his contribution made to a private retirement scheme where the withdrawal is made by that individual before reaching the age of fifty-five (other than by reason of death or permanently leaving Malaysia) at the appropriate rate as specified under Part XVI of Schedule 1.”. Pindaan seksyen 8"
      }
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2012/35/msa@/~part_I__cl_7",
      "@type": "akn:clause",
      "eli:number": "7",
      "hasPart": [
        "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2012/35/msa@/~part_I__cl_7__para_a",
        "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2012/35/msa@/~part_I__cl_7__para_b"
      ],
      "isPartOf": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2012/35/msa@/~part_I",
      "schema:name": {
        "@language": "ms",
        "@value": "Seksyen 8 Akta ibu dipinda—"
      }
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2012/35/msa@/~part_I__cl_7__para_a",
      "@type": "akn:paragraph",
      "eli:number": "a",
      "isPartOf": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2012/35/msa@/~part_I__cl_7",
      "schema:text": {
        "@language": "ms",
        "@value": "dengan memasukkan selepas subseksyen (1), subseksyen yang berikut: “(1A) Notwithstanding subsection (1), for the purposes of this Act— (a) a limited liability partnership carrying on a business is resident in Malaysia for the basis year for a year of assessment if at any time during that basis year the management and control of its business or of any one of its businesses, as the case may be, are exercised in Malaysia; (b) any other limited liability partnership is resident in Malaysia for the basis year for a year of assessment if at any time during that basis year the management and control of its affairs are exercised in Malaysia by its partners; (c) a business trust is resident in Malaysia for the basis year for a year of assessment if the trustee manager of that business trust is resident in Malaysia and a trustee manager of a business trust is resident for the basis year for a year of assessment if— (i) the trustee manager in his capacity as such carries on such business trust in Malaysia; and (ii) the management and control of the business of such business trust is exercised in Malaysia.”; dan"
      }
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2012/35/msa@/~part_I__cl_7__para_b",
